        "extension": [
          {
            "url": "lang",
            "valueCode": "sv"
          },
          {
            "url": "content",
            "valueString": "Denna blanketten kartlägger dina rökvanor.\nFagerström test av nikotinberoende (HSI)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation",
        "extension": [
          {
            "url": "lang",
            "valueCode": "en"
          },
          {
            "url": "content",
            "valueString": "This survey is designed to assess your smoking habits.\nFagerström test for nicotine dependence (HSI)"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "linkId": "9fd9228f-77e5-495b-ab95-b8c62cae40bc",
      "text": "Ohje",
      "_text": {
        "extension": [
          {
            "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation",
            "extension": [
              {
                "url": "lang",
                "valueCode": "sv"
              },
              {
                "url": "content",
                "valueString": "Instruktion"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation",
            "extension": [
              {
                "url": "lang",
                "valueCode": "en"
              },
              {
                "url": "content",
                "valueString": "Instruction"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "group",
      "item": [
        {
          "linkId": "82f13d20-5f6d-44a7-8347-3cf2620f4c88",
          "text": "Antamasi tiedot tallentuvat Lunnaan, mutta huomioithan että lomake ei automaattisesti päädy ammattilaisen tarkasteltavaksi, eikä lomakkeen täyttäminen toimi yhteydenottokanavana. Olethan tarvittaessa yhteydessä ammattilaiseen, ellei ammattilainen ole jo pyytänyt sinua täyttämään tätä lomaketta.",
          "_text": {
            "extension": [
              {
                "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation",
                "extension": [
                  {
                    "url": "lang",
                    "valueCode": "sv"
                  },
                  {
                    "url": "content",
                    "valueString": "De uppgifter du lämnat sparas på Lunna, men observera att blanketten inte automatiskt skickas till en yrkesperson för granskning och att ifyllandet av blanketten inte fungerar som en kontaktkanal. Vänligen kontakta en yrkesperson vid behov, om inte en yrkesperson redan har bett dig att fylla i denna blanketten."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "url": "http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation",
                "extension": [
                  {
                    "url": "lang",
                    "valueCode": "en"
                  },
                  {
                    "url": "content",
                    "valueString": "The information you provide will be stored on Lunna, but please note that the form will not automatically be reviewed by a professional, nor does filling out the form serve as a contact channel. Please contact a professional if necessary, unless a professional has already asked you to fill out this form."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "type": "display"
        }
      ]
    },
